By total probability P(\text{late})=\frac{2}{5}\times\frac{1}{5}+\frac{1}{5}\times\frac{1}{3}+\frac{2}{5}\times\frac{1}{4}=\frac{37}{150}
Bayes gives P(\text{bus}|\text{late})=\frac{(2/5)(1/5)}{37/150}=\frac{12}{150}\times\frac{150}{37}
Simplifying yields \frac{12}{37} → (B)

